        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Eta channel: a 3x3 grid, W from 1.55 to 1.75 GeV, Q2 from 0.5 to 1.5 GeV2, at cos theta* = 0 and phi* = 90.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_088a286130013iSpXxEkkUZI9A",
          "sessionID": "ses_f775d7a02ffeqqCZsc7TtZ4MJY",
          "messageID": "msg_088a28610001XPorKZVhS7VuTK"
